    "detailed_description": "<h1>Highlights</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/d6d38a97ec74cf0bd516ef2738e22ee9.avif?t=1754615026\" width=600 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calling the emergency room on the 13th of every month is no longer a good choice. The 911 emergency room system has been hacked and has become a human resource for a satanist doctor. The devil wants sacrifices and Doctor W, a slave to the devil, ruthlessly offers innocent people to him. Our player, a journalist, aims to escape from the hospital and destroy this organization by collecting evidence. Are you ready for this fearful, puzzle-filled and suspenseful struggle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/7427ddb242022211f61aaf9773f9bf0a.avif?t=1754615026\" width=400 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/31e377ea93fb05121c516be9aa6ddd47.poster.avif?t=1754615026\" width=542 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/31e377ea93fb05121c516be9aa6ddd47.webm?t=1754615026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/6a4ff8a795d89e97df70b73a041e52a9.avif?t=1754615026\" width=400 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/b43c8f15010747ec3ddea3a3f0392aee.poster.avif?t=1754615026\" width=542 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/b43c8f15010747ec3ddea3a3f0392aee.webm?t=1754615026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/a5153541c2ba7ed856fc7c5bf1009e3c.avif?t=1754615026\" width=400 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/e6b9f041fd388e29787243a50d23ef8d.poster.avif?t=1754615026\" width=542 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/e6b9f041fd388e29787243a50d23ef8d.webm?t=1754615026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/e6b9f041fd388e29787243a50d23ef8d.mp4?t=1754615026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/d6d38a97ec74cf0bd516ef2738e22ee9.avif?t=1754615026\" width=600 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calling the emergency room on the 13th of every month is no longer a good choice. The 911 emergency room system has been hacked and has become a human resource for a satanist doctor. The devil wants sacrifices and Doctor W, a slave to the devil, ruthlessly offers innocent people to him. Our player, a journalist, aims to escape from the hospital and destroy this organization by collecting evidence. Are you ready for this fearful, puzzle-filled and suspenseful struggle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/7427ddb242022211f61aaf9773f9bf0a.avif?t=1754615026\" width=400 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/31e377ea93fb05121c516be9aa6ddd47.poster.avif?t=1754615026\" width=542 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/31e377ea93fb05121c516be9aa6ddd47.webm?t=1754615026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177660/extras/6a4ff8a795d89e97df70b73a041e52a9.avif?t=1754615026\" width=400 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps